  "limitations": [
    "FPS is the game's complete builtin benchmark result; completed NR jobs never provide game FPS.",
    "Game frame times are exported rounded to0.01ms; percentiles use linear interpolation, all rows/outliers retained.",
    "Three-pass SD/CV use sample SD(n-1) and describe repeat variation, not confidence intervals.",
    "Pooled game frame statistics weight by frame count; pass percentiles are not averaged.",
    "No PresentMon capture, producer timestamps, per-present runtime join, or inferred whole-world runtime membership.",
    "Runtime publication prefix snapshots and counters are asynchronous; counter changes are not per-frame bypass attribution.",
    "Runtime neural_ms includes bridge/waits and is not network-only time or a sum of stage medians.",
    "Game/driver FG-off controls are external observations; the unchanged Enabled driver upscaling override prevents an independently established effective FSR version.",
    "Private raw game exports, assets, captures, models, settings files and absolute machine paths are excluded from this public scalar record.",
    "Earlier alpha2 runtime and shader identities remain separate measurements; this record does not relabel earlier observations or prove NVIDIA runtime parity."
